    <title>EHAXCTF 2026: Reverse Engineering Write-up</title>
    <link href="https://4r12u.github.io/posts/ehaxctf-2026-reverse-engineering/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <id>https://4r12u.github.io/posts/ehaxctf-2026-reverse-engineering/</id>
    <published>2026-03-04T00:00:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-03-04T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
    <summary>Reverse engineering notes from EHAXCTF 2026, including crackmes, path validation, and numerical analysis.</summary>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>This is my reverse engineering write-up for <strong>EHAXCTF 2026</strong>. The solutions below show the parts of each binary that mattered, together with the small scripts used to recover the flags.</p>
<section class="markdown-section"><h2 id="iguessbro">IGuessbro<a class="anchor" href="https://4r12u.github.io/posts/ehaxctf-2026-reverse-engineering/#iguessbro"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore>#</span></a></h2><p>The binary eventually calls <code>flagPrinter</code>, which reads a 35-character candidate and checks it with three functions: <code>DecodeAndCompareString</code>, <code>CheckMathProperties</code>, and <code>CheckHash</code>.</p><p><code>DecodeAndCompareString</code> decodes a 35-byte constant using an index-dependent XOR:</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame" data-language="c"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="c" class="wrap" style="--ecMaxLine:41ch"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">1</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70">decoded</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">[i] </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70">encoded</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">[i] </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">^</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> (i </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">*</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">7</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">) </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">^</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">0x</span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">A5</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">;</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy-btn-icon"></div></figure></div><p>The encoded bytes recovered from <code>.rodata</code> are:</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame" data-language="python"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="python" class="wrap" style="--ecMaxLine:63ch"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">1</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">encoded </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> [</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:4ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">2</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">0x</span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">E0</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">, </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">0x</span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">EA</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">, </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">0x</span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">9F</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">, </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">0x</span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">E8</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">, </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">0x</span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">C2</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">, </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">0x</span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">FF</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">, </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">0x</span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">BF</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">, </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">0x</span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">E1</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">, </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">0x</span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">C2</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">, </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">0x</span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">FD</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">,</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:4ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">3</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--0:#BF3