mage </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">*</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> d_image </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">+</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> f_real </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">*</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> d_real) </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">/</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> denominator</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:8ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">12</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">        </span></span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">image </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">-=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> (f_image </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">*</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> d_real </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">-</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> f_real </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">*</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> d_image) </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">/</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> denominator</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:8ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">13</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">        </span></span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">count </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">+=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">1</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:8ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">14</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">        </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">if</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">abs</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(real </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">-</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">1.0</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">) </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">&lt;</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">1e-6</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">and</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">abs</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(image) </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">&lt;</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">1e-6</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">:</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:12ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">15</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">            </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">break</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:4ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">16</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">return</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> count </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">==</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">12</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy-btn-icon"></div></figure></div><p>Rendering the bit grid reveals:</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame" data-language="text"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="text" class="wrap" style="--ecMaxLine:22ch"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">1</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292e;--1:#e1e4e8">EH4X{N3WTON_W45_R1GHT}</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy-btn-icon"></div></figure></div></section>
<section class="markdown-section"><h2 id="kaje">Kaje<a class="anchor" href="https://4r12u.github.io/posts/ehaxctf-2026-reverse-engineering/#kaje"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore>#</span></a></h2><p><code>main</code> generates entropy, derives a keystream, and XORs it with two 16-byte constants before printing the result. The important reversing step is reconstructing <code>gen_entropy</code> and <code>gen_keystream</code>, then reproducing the XOR with the constants loaded from <code>.rodata</code>. The provided <code>kaje</code> binary and IDA database are kept in the source repository for the remaining constant values and solver.</p></section>
<section class="markdown-section"><h2 id="summary">Summary<a class="anchor" href="https://4r12u.github.io/posts/ehaxctf-2026-reverse-engineering/#summary"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore>#</span></a></h2><p>The complete challenge files, binaries, scripts, and the original Vietnamese notes are available in the <a href="https://github.com/4r12u/EhaxCTF2026_WU" data-content-link-kind="external" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">EhaxCTF2026_WU repository</a>.</p></section>]]></content>
